  "content": "\n\nPlease provide the text you would like translated into zh-CN.\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《掠夺者入侵》将 Minecraft 中的掠夺者提升至全新境界！近十种拥有独特能力的新掠夺者现已在你的世界中游荡。有些潜伏在危险的新结构中，有些则加入村庄袭击，让战斗更加艰难。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">迎战更聪明的敌人，寻找强力战利品，探索隐秘之地。新的挑战意味着新的奖励——以及一路上的无尽乐趣！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 新掠夺者</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">炼金术士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：精通弓箭的专家，被激怒时会投掷滞留药水。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">档案员</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：用附魔增益附近的掠夺者。受惊时会逃跑并施放法术。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">猛击者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：手持盾牌的重装掠夺者，会冲锋撞向玩家。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">劫掠者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：远程攻击的掠夺者，会投掷致命的短斧——从它身上夺取 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">淬炼铂金斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 吧！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">挑衅者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：使用弓箭的掠夺者，掌握基础增益法术。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔮 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">术士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：行踪诡秘的施法者，能召唤危险的紫色火焰。掉落 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">奇异粉尘</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧟 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">死灵法师</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：亡灵大师，通过召唤法术压制玩家。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">审判官</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：实力强大的掠夺者战士，手持坚固盾牌——击败他前请先破盾！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">唤火者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：看似无害的神秘法师——直到他释放出毁灭性的魔法。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">召唤者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：最强大的掠夺者！掉落 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">神圣宝石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，用于配合 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">灌注台</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 升级附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎭 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幻术师</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：现已加入生存模式并拥有全新外观！掉落 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幻术粉尘</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏰 新结构</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">唤火者小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：带有农田的小房子。生成于恶地生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏰 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠夺者堡垒</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：设有围墙、高塔和强力掠夺者的要塞。生成于针叶林生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🗼 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幻术师高塔</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：多层高塔，内部布满掠夺者，顶层会有幻术师战斗。生成于针叶林和深色森林生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">迷宫</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：巨大的地下迷宫，充满丰厚战利品和更多掠夺者。留意石庙入口！生成于大多数森林生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛖 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">术士小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：小型房屋结构。生成于深色森林生物群系。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ 新装备与物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">灌注台</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：突破常规限制升级附魔！每次使用需消耗一颗 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">神圣宝石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">淬炼铂金斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：类似斧头的投掷武器，由劫掠者罕见掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🕯️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">寻矿蜡烛</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：通过揭示位置帮助定位附近的矿石。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">洞察之角</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：使附近怪物发光，助你更快发现它们！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端必须安装，服务端必需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric &amp; NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模组支持配置，可直接在游戏内使用模组菜单进行设置（Fabric 端需安装 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 开发）。请注意，在较旧的 Minecraft 版本中，还需安装 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 目录下，文件名根据配置类型分别为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。并非所有类型的配置文件都会存在，具体取决于模组。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特别感谢 </span><a href=\"https://github.com/OhDricky\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Dricky</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，他最初创作了令人惊叹的《掠夺者扩展》模组。《掠夺者入侵》忠实延续了其作品，并进行了大量新增内容、优化、重构与漏洞修复。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/ZekeSmith\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">ZekeSmith</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，他在 Dricky 删除原版代码后重新找到了《掠夺者扩展》的源代码，使得本次移植在 </span><a href=\"https://spdx.org/licenses/MIT.html\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MIT</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 许可条款下得以实现。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/safrodev\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">safrodev</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 对 1.19.2 版《掠夺者扩展》的开发工作，“洞察之角”的纹理即取自该版本。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 创作了大量精美的新纹理。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-animations-collection\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/betteranimationscollection/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/effect-descriptions\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectdescriptions/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
